==French==

===Etymology===
From {{term|de||of, from|lang=fr}} and {{term|rien||nothing|lang=fr}}. Literally meaning "of nothing".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/də ʁjɛ̃/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|Fr-de rien-fr-Paris.ogg|audio (Paris)}}

===Interjection===
{{fr-intj|sg={{l/fr|de}} {{l/fr|rien}}}}

# {{context|after being thanked|lang=fr}} Direct translation [[''of nothing'']]. 

English comparable equivalents [[''it's nothing'']] also [[''Don't mention it'']] and [[''You're welcome'']]

====Synonyms====
* [[pas de quoi]]

